      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Applications for funds under all programs listed in Appendix A must follow the procedure established in Circular A-95. Most of the programs listed were already subject to very similar review procedures under Section 204 of the Demonstration Cities and Metropolitan Development Act of 1966. The Circular A-95 supersedes and modifies these prior procedures.",
