      "text": "II. City agency notifies both clearinghouses. The city agency prepares two letters of intent briefly summarizing the project. (The requirements governing the contents of the letters are set forth in Appendix B.) One letter is sent to the State clearinghouse and the other to the Metropolitan clearinghouse.",
